# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env* is gitignored.

# Solana RPC endpoint. Optional — defaults to the public devnet endpoint.
#
# Why you'd set this: the public endpoint (api.devnet.solana.com) works, but it
# rate-limits per IP, so balance lookups get throttled and intermittently return
# unknown. A provider key gets you per-key limits instead.
#
# Note: this does NOT affect funding. There is no in-app airdrop — the public
# faucet returns 429 essentially always, so users are sent to the official
# faucet at https://faucet.solana.com instead.
#
# Free devnet endpoints:
#   Helius     https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
#   QuickNode  https://YOUR-ENDPOINT.solana-devnet.quiknode.pro/YOUR_TOKEN/
#   Alchemy    https://solana-devnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
#
# SECURITY: this is NEXT_PUBLIC_, so it is visible to anyone who loads the page.
# That is unavoidable for a browser-side RPC connection. Use a key restricted to
# your domain, never an unrestricted one.
#
# The network badge in the navbar is derived from this URL, so if you point it at
# mainnet the UI will say "Mainnet" in red rather than silently claiming devnet.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_RPC_URL=
